{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ffd2965537969aa95f8b23b789eff2595227714c67830de9c472d59098c8e8c9",
      "text": "Um, next is...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d557f8454392ce127d6985adf97d8e763fff6a476fb490ca75ef1da86c8269e8",
      "text": "Alk, the pot is about to boil over.\nShall I turn it off?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:69279a637db295f06ebcf2f96de5cc9b1496e7fa43d91e8f59fad5751a209b19",
      "text": "Please! ...Ahh, I need more hands!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4fbbb7abfecad8d57c22eba0722761755a9186776cfde1e734f0893c9508d3b8",
      "text": "The Oudo of haste. Is something\nwrong?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c50abcef1aae2fa4655be852a37f094d43157576b93d58c4b69813e60245721",
      "text": "We are preparing dinner. There are\nmore people than usual today.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:65ccc0e930b07bb40d4ddedae64dc2bd870a83c2b804e485981d4ef7f9913d60",
      "text": "Alk and Stella are doing all that\nalone?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:985736adcbb0b79cfba33f342bd54920f4fca81f4169710d85c1afeeb2c59739",
      "text": "...No, I only do odd jobs.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d216e6d20712132b4d705ac2750fde23c5275000c98c5e5ba6b223f4c16520a",
      "text": "Usually Shirano and the others help\ntoo! But everyone has plans today!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:698c44115789a12905fa82941ba8d50ede0be7b58ec9e77a6b425b68fae844b0",
      "text": "Nisues will help.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:297e83c2312033e084566828a32c800a9247f7b0854e7842f3eafb529985f50c",
      "text": "In the settlement, Nisues helped\nwith cooking too. If Nisues learns\nhow, Nisues can surely be useful.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2fa1ef0bc1442d4150ad192ae622c1ea27260aae449f31d058646cd9ec8684e0",
      "text": "That's a relief...!! Then please\nhandle the ingredients over there!\nI'll start on the soup!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:91050d20e8aa4db4d344dc76a0b134c833f143542527607eada9035a887c0b90",
      "text": "S-still more? That seems like\nplenty already.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:df2f889e5932121ba28df574a3f84eb99ac4fde129a8c3189d07346c949ee031",
      "text": "Hmm, true, but with Nisues helping,\nI figured we could do even more.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bdaf4741e36e3a510249f8636b86355b9dbc434f31c12d99b609265a50c300b8",
      "text": "Besides, it's nicer if everyone can\neat deliciously together, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39bfbf0c95dcc3e708b4143244812bf3e7a1fb68ebb692c811ccf38e93d484ac",
      "text": "—! Nisues thinks so too...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f28c0c0b0aa0ad85b5041ca4c6238650599e381810c93ef449f27dd07ed1459f",
      "text": "Understood...! Nisues will do her\nbest!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bd4f5449ef4be2394f7eeb7b47470776363a3f5b5531435eb4b670560f83922f",
      "text": "Nisues was amazing...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3b90fed091c151fe4d935ec0761d6ea24b844e7691044d1f4e25c65a5e1d319c",
      "text": "Yeah, thanks to you, we made it in\ntime... Really, thank you, Nisues.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39c9f42bc6b65e00ab72c5541edf35613244ce89ecc3b5c8f03707f1b8640f80",
      "text": "Let us help you sometime too. As\nthanks for today.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c316aa3c6e5fcb75b16a209e55467c3da031887411436058874ded80f235822",
      "text": "No, it is all right. Eating something\ndelicious with everyone. Nisues\nunderstands that is a happy thing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2dd1109bd298e46329d5f7b470958fb378f6b27c9118b2d479f8bf4bc68036ee",
      "text": "Nisues is the same as Alk.\nEveryone's Oudo of joy makes Nisues\nglad and happy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:137ae08b376403112e5cf8d651631290d11c887bda9eedef5ff98b64846c6ae1",
      "text": "So Nisues is truly happy like this.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c38428f020d2d47f00fd96df016da022763cebf00a92f682871fac705a1b123",
      "text": "...I see. So that's how it is for\nyou, Nisues...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc87562a3eb40f6b1f7054e8e3fc8e9a9f3e3d9d8dd3d15b0c787aa4cb4b672a",
      "text": "In my case, the difference is\nprobably that I want it to be my\nown cooking...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b20a0e35d52cf9c661c4b1273a175c75fc3f3e0ebc154ea535c64e6757c2910a",
      "text": "...What makes Nisues happy? What\ndoes Nisues want to do?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a4fcf77527e16bc1874a5db6e9e4010589c8c09e8eb9c7fe8afc0fbbaebbf48c",
      "text": "What Nisues wants to do?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6f7e49d4164b65b6bdcde2787d335edffec41e5ab79fc155424b98599f388cf",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dc02e31de4a4fa0e4666877e232f1ad095bad0e066ed3c9085a7e25096f02aba",
      "text": "Stella, you are not... worried\nabout Nisues...? You only want to\nknow Nisues's wish...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de5f4316ed838f66bd2d34a97636526f4a1f5e7946cd226cab5bbbac29d3d255",
      "text": "You only want to know what Nisues\nwishes for...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cdbfaef37ed0726226f463b16acd615358a346eddbd9ae3b5ea503fd0e228695",
      "text": "Nisues's wish...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff5f91a8973dc1c6508e870e2f364877079255ec4b7504efc12d67ada1e47935",
      "text": "Um, well... That is—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9d4684a1de320661f2d92e30bd8db167c1e543b90327b1048a065d461c2e180d",
      "text": "S-sorry... I cannot think of\nanything so suddenly... Nisues has\nno complaints...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff3a817574f41c00cb5e194ffbb6df58b369d3ca15098cd52de9c9d5651b691d",
      "text": "Adventuring is fun. But what Nisues\nwants to do...? Nisues... is...?\nWh-what is Nisues...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ecaff3f6707b4d11f6b62ab7add6a91989bb4789bd9d0dc9b386e8d0fd6ee429",
      "text": "S-sorry, sorry...! We shouldn't\nforce it out of you!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:19d204140be513189db4b5d30d375a4ed819bfe58fff2b6f3777cdcaa40a8ed1",
      "text": "Anyway, if you think of anything,\nI'll help any time. Just say\nsomething, okay?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793",
      "text": "Y-yes...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:114b20035a0b96e016ae5ab30da09b7dbc00a57619829a20d839ac0c76c9519b",
      "text": "Sorry, did I keep you waiting?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f93dcaf39d773d75819a74e93d53ccd577a722510c6ecf1c6229867ac2cd7aa1",
      "text": "No...! It was Nisues who called\nyou! Please, sit down...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "167": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:be8437271e18858713916046e03bd63ed05b376ef1618d27b227456e4f5ef2fb",
      "text": "Nisues has been thinking since\nthen. What Nisues wants help from\nAlk and the others with—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:918d4eabaaac7ddb6fb59df6c4226129005a6c28c37b6fe5b4cd4d04864d3b5a",
      "text": "What makes Nisues happy. What\nNisues wants to do.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7d86bc7d4da16aa7f8a20c27d679f862b31673892f7d56cd5be2dc9ed1463eb0",
      "text": "—But it's not going well?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:db996863f44774f1e80f1e7e5bba0170a6799fad7718d6c43250c10b974bdf9f",
      "text": "Yes. That is so.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bebd2d8a942376f5ed5d4d23be2cb3f14479b4b445218e6dfefd00e4f3be02cc",
      "text": "Adventuring, playing, going to\nother worlds, even just helping...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a00f9958a332f2299fc08afa573e12145d12e293400d43b5caaad74f99eed6e4",
      "text": "Nisues truly has fun with all of\nthem—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:87f56bce80938846d604cbec68e96785821dd123c377333507121732ff998ca3",
      "text": "And yet Nisues cannot answer\nStella.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0f3cbce61686997ac7c37603ede31fc78c08c5b9be0d818877f9b12c0821c076",
      "text": "...I see. I don't think that's bad,\nthough.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:24a941c32b81b4de784a4f2b0c82b7743fab2afc4c0f8b667c0b765b78d70d79",
      "text": "Even so, you want to know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:41a9ff34bfbd05eb7f9a59fcb23463adf2d404640ef5920a1788f0bcd190af05",
      "text": "Yes. So, for the thank-you help,\nNisues has decided on a wish.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ae39f9f21e54bc0e42b01a045215e02beef619abe73b78b11131f1a28b1d213",
      "text": "Nisues will look for Nisues. Nisues\nwould like you to help with that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "213": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ce27c1002bf81d7ffc5873950a7d5714c60fb6b56ff603a4e078243c14e307e0",
      "text": "...You're really, really serious.\nIt's a thank-you, so of course I'll\nhelp.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "218": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d0fb22e4850d396f8a5887273e7c065971ffd4b4406539c2e748f1c7fe5db54",
      "text": "Then it is a treasure hunt.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7c44af5b93177e5413043746accd87886bd232ddd6313580f8e27597e578bd80",
      "text": "Let's look for what you like.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:36ef2362f7603966014cfafd73dc7cd1760c6c7736800398b1a9d54fb7a86889",
      "text": "—Yes!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "228": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:07d2e02e09131e6695c15651bef82a742155fc5a53126f2d467df7cb0f80b702",
      "text": "For Stella and the others too,\nNisues will do her best to find\nherself...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d99dfd4ff04cbd6789a0560f07915b02a8a2b9361bced3d62a9c08802f29ed3",
      "text": "Hmm, hardcore serious...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
